  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Women&apos;s Movement: NGOCC - Support to the Women&apos;s Movement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to the Women&apos;s Movement: NGOCC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Non-Governmental Gender Organisations Coordinating Council (NGOCC) i Zambia har ans&#xf6;kt om st&#xf6;d till ett v&#xe4;rde av 40 miljoner SEK f&#xf6;r att implementera sin strategiska plan f&#xf6;r perioden 2018 till 2022. 

Insatsens syfte &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kvinnors och flickors tillg&#xe5;ng till och kontroll &#xf6;ver resurser, sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa, representation och politiskt deltagande p&#xe5; alla niv&#xe5;er, och minska kvinnors utsatthet f&#xf6;r klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar. NGOCC kommer att implementera insatsen genom sina medlemsorganisationer. 

Insatsens totala budget uppg&#xe5;r till 97 miljoner SEK (ZMW 109 miljoner). Utav den totala budgeten s&#xe5; utg&#xf6;rs cirka 4,4 miljoner SEK av organisationens egna medel och 17,8 miljoner av medel fr&#xe5;n andra givare (WeEffect, IM Sverige, EU, CHAZ och NED). De &#xe5;terst&#xe5;ende 74,8 miljonerna (SEK) &#xe4;r inte s&#xe4;krade &#xe4;nnu. Cirka 23,3 miljoner SEK av den totala budgeten kommer att vidaref&#xf6;rmedlas fr&#xe5;n NGOCC genom organisationens Basket Fund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Non-Governmental Gender Organisations Coordinating Council (NGOCC) in Zambia has applied to Sida for funding of 40 million SEK to implement their strategic plan &quot;Building Solidarity for Women&apos;s Empowerment&quot; for the period 2018 to 2022. 

The intervention aims at improving women&apos;s and girls&apos; access to and control of resources, sexual and reproductive health, representation and participation of women in governance and leadership at all levels and reducing vulnerability of women to climate change impacts and strengthening their capacity to manage natural resources. NGOCC will implement the intervention with its member organisations.

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 97 million SEK (ZMW 109million), out of which the organisation&#x2019;s own funding is approximately 4.4 million SEK (ZMW 4.9 million), other donor funding from We Effect, IM Swedish, the EU, CHAZ &amp; NED is 17.8 million SEK (ZMW 20 million) and the remaining 74.8 million SEK (ZMW 83.9 million) not yet secured. Approximately 23.3 million SEK (ZMW 26 million) of the intervention budget will be forwarded from NGOCC to sub-grantees through its &apos;Basket Fund&apos; .</narrative>
  </description>
